        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5562b1ba-d12e-428d-886e-bc9f2c80c2f2).Image",
        "Description": "A wealthy client has contracted you to eliminate Taita the Shaman. Taita has forced a major construction project to come to a halt. This project means millions for our client. They have agreed to pay the sum of $650,000 USD for his death. Do this as cleanly as possible as not to arouse suspicon from the locals. Yet again you have been caught with less gear than normal, although you were able to grab your concealable baton and earphones. Fix the problem. Eliminate All Targets.",
